    {
      "id": "sum-83ea75",
      "kind": "controversy",
      "body": "Open issue #3220 asks whether the control should be made technology-agnostic (any naming/directory lookup) and whether 'sanitizes' is the right verb. jmanico favours genericizing; tghosth has asked for examples as damaging as JNDI remote class loading. #3214 (sanitization vs allowlisting) was closed as a duplicate of #3220.",
